{
  "story": "Start with equally trained trials and compare validation accuracy. Keep the stronger half, then resume only those trials with a larger budget. Advance through the checkpoints to see how each comparison determines who receives more training.",
  "aha": {
    "stateId": "final-budget",
    "observation": "Successive halving gives more training only to the top half at each equal-budget checkpoint, using their current validation scores."
  },
